# Learn2Trade Frontend Guide

Use this rule as the map of the frontend. Before implementing a feature or fix, locate the right code and docs paths below. Prefer the smallest change that matches existing patterns.

## Stack (verify in `package.json`)

- Angular + Material + CDK ^22
- RxJS 7.8, Zone.js present
- Vitest unit tests (`ng test`); Playwright e2e (`npm run test:e2e`)
- Charts: `lightweight-charts`
- Toasts: `ngx-mat-toast`

Also follow always-on rules: `angular-expert.mdc`, `material-expert.mdc`, and `agents.md` at the frontend root.

## Path aliases (`tsconfig.json`)

Prefer these over deep relative imports:

| Alias | Maps to |
| --- | --- |
| `@styles/*` | `./src/styles/*` |
| `@components/*` | `./src/app/components/*` |
| `@shared/*` | `./src/app/components/shared/*` |
| `@const/*` | `./src/app/const/*` |
| `@core/*` | `./src/app/core/*` |
| `@env/*` | `./src/app/env/*` |
| `@guards/*` | `./src/app/guards/*` |
| `@services/*` | `./src/app/services/*` |

Same-folder `./` imports may stay relative. For shared UI, prefer `@shared/...` over `@components/shared/...`.

